      },
      "publicNotes": "<h2>Appearance</h2>\n<p>Two grey, sagging heads with milky eyes and drooping lips, tilted toward the bone cairn in the alcove.</p>",
      "privateNotes": "<p><strong>@UUID[Compendium.points-of-interest.journals.JournalEntry.jxn9bB1XhZTRpF65.JournalEntryPage.wdlbFe4qIZDYqrwL]{03. Nine Mouths, One Belly}.</strong> The two Old Heads, the bloc that guards their mother's bones. They share the Jotund Troll's defences, which take any damage; Religion and Barrow Lore are what they know.</p>"
    },
